# React Native / Expo tooling (Metro's resolver, Gradle autolinking, CocoaPods) assumes a
# flat node_modules. pnpm's default isolated layout breaks all three in ways that surface
# only at bundle or build time. Expo's own monorepo guidance is to hoist.
# This costs pnpm's strictness (a package can require something it did not declare) —
# tools/check-deps.mjs reads package.json, not the tree, so the dependency gate is unaffected.
node-linker=hoisted
